Reworked the storage layer (`diffsync.store`) around a template-method `Store` base class: key prefixing, validation and codec-based (de)serialisation are centralised, backend I/O is provided via `_raw_*` hooks and codecs are pluggable. `LocalStore` is now shelve-backed and `RedisStore` preserves the historical key layout and pickle payload exactly. Added a read-only `/stores` endpoint in `diffsync.api` reporting codec, key count and round-trip verification (HTTP 409 with the failing keys on mismatch).
